    "created_at": "2016-05-30T09:15:21Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-05-30T09:15:21Z",
    "body": "So the main reason navigate handles redirects specially is redirects to unknown schemes. Per Fetch those result in a network error, but they need to work for navigate supposedly.\n\nIf that is a thing it would probably be useful for Fetch to either abstract its `Location` header parsing or expose that as a property of a redirect response somehow.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
